## Symlink-target verification (AC-3)
Pre-edit gate the implementer MUST execute on the implementing machine:
```bash
test -L .claude/CLAUDE.md && echo "SYMLINK" || echo "REGULAR"
readlink -f .claude/CLAUDE.md
```
- If `REGULAR` (current state in this repo): edit `.claude/CLAUDE.md` in place.
- If `SYMLINK`: edit the resolved target inside SDD_HOME, NOT the symlink path; otherwise next `bin/sdd update` byte-diff clobbers the change. Record state in `decisions.md`.

